<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-COLLATED AFRICAN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLLATED AFRICAN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated scores of African</p>
<p>club competition semifinal, second leg matches played at the</p>
<p>weekend:</p>
<p>African Champions Cup:</p>
<p>In Alexandria:</p>
<p>Zamalek (Egypt) 1 CS Sfaxien (Tunisia) 0 (half-time 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Mohamed Sabri (19th min penalty)</p>
<p>1-1 on aggregate. Zamalek won 4-3 on penalties</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>In Ibadan:</p>
<p>Shooting Stars (Nigeria) 1 JS Kabylie (Algeria) 0 (half-time</p>
<p>0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>David Ogaga (78th)</p>
<p>Shooting Stars won 2-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>African Cup Winners' Cup:</p>
<p>In Kinshasa:</p>
<p>Sodigraf (Zaire) 1 CR Belouizdad (Algeria) 0 (half-time 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Mbuilua Tondelwa (89th)</p>
<p>Sodigraf won 2-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
<p>In Yaounde:</p>
<p>Canon Yaounde (Cameroon) 1 Arab Contractors (Egypt) 1</p>
<p>(half-time 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Canon Yaounde - Jupiter Nangwe (85th pen)</p>
<p>Arab Contractors - Taher El Mahas (55th)</p>
<p>Arab Contractors won 3-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup:</p>
<p>In Kinshasa:</p>
<p>Vita Club (Zaire) 2 Etoile du Sahel (Tunisia) 1 (half-time</p>
<p>1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Vita Club - Luende Mulangana (2nd pen), Boeka Lisani (73rd)</p>
<p>Etoile du Sahel - Zoubier Beya (44th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000</p>
<p>In Nairobi:</p>
<p>Kenya Breweries (Kenya) 1 Kawkab Marrakesh (Morocco) 0</p>
<p>(half-time 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>George Maina (89th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
</text>
